WEBVTT

00:07.724 --> 00:09.000
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.068 --> 00:10.689
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.758 --> 00:12.172
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.241 --> 00:14.137
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.206 --> 00:17.206
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.275 --> 00:19.275
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.344 --> 00:21.275
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.344 --> 00:23.172
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.241 --> 00:24.862
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:24.931 --> 00:27.275
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.344 --> 00:29.068
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.137 --> 00:31.241
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.310 --> 00:33.275
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.344 --> 00:35.137
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.206 --> 00:37.275
SpongeBob
SquarePants!
海绵宝宝
方裤！

00:37.344 --> 00:39.413
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.482 --> 00:40.724
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.793 --> 00:42.586
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.655 --> 00:45.344
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.413 --> 00:47.586
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:47.655 --> 00:49.206
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:51.689 --> 00:54.620
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:54.689 --> 01:00.758
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:00.827 --> 01:03.241
[cheering, chatter]
[欢呼声、议论声]

01:03.310 --> 01:04.241
- Perch Perkins here
- 鲈鱼帕金斯在这里

01:04.310 --> 01:05.793
for Bikini Bottom News.
比基尼泳裤新闻。

01:05.862 --> 01:09.896
Today SpongeBob SquarePants
will attempt the impossible:
今天海绵宝宝
会尝试不可能的事情：

01:09.965 --> 01:12.655
a high-sea dive
from that diving board!
公海潜水
从那个跳水板上！

01:12.724 --> 01:17.482
He'll be the first sponge ever
to dive up through the ocean.
他将成为史上第一块海绵
潜入海洋。

01:17.551 --> 01:18.827
- Mow.
- 哞。

01:18.896 --> 01:20.482
- Did you hear
what Perch said, Gary?
- 你听到了吗
珀奇说什么，加里？

01:20.551 --> 01:22.379
The first sponge!
第一个海绵！

01:22.448 --> 01:24.172
- Whoa.
- 哇哦。

01:24.241 --> 01:26.034
[triumphant music]
[胜利的音乐]

01:26.103 --> 01:27.689
- Pretty cool, huh, kid?
- 很酷吧，孩子？

01:29.137 --> 01:30.655
- Ahh!
- 啊！

01:33.137 --> 01:34.793
Okay, Gary, that's enough lard.
好吧，加里，猪油就够了。

01:34.862 --> 01:35.793
I gotta warm up.
我得热身一下。

01:35.862 --> 01:37.275
[grunts]
[咕哝]

01:38.206 --> 01:39.965
[groaning]
[呻吟]

01:40.034 --> 01:43.758
[straining]
[紧张]

01:43.827 --> 01:44.793
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

01:44.862 --> 01:46.517
Whaa--oh!
哇——哦！

01:47.655 --> 01:49.379
That's good.
I'm all warmed up.
那挺好的。
我都热身了。

01:49.448 --> 01:52.241
- Get your SpongeBob
standees here!
- 获取你的海绵宝宝
站在这里！

01:52.310 --> 01:55.068
Buy one and take home a hero!
买一个，带一个英雄回家！

01:55.137 --> 01:56.965
Here you are, here!
Here!
你在这里，在这里！
这里！

01:57.034 --> 01:59.137
- [sobbing]
- [抽泣]

01:59.206 --> 02:01.517
- Hey, SpongeBob.
What's new?
- 嘿，海绵宝宝。
什么是新的？

02:03.586 --> 02:06.620
Oh, so that's how it is, huh?
哦，原来是这样啊？

02:06.689 --> 02:08.448
The silent treatment.
沉默的对待。

02:08.517 --> 02:10.862
Well, two can play
at that game, mister!
还好两个人可以玩
在那场比赛中，先生！

02:10.931 --> 02:12.482
[huffs]
- Excuse me.
[怒气]
- 对不起。

02:12.551 --> 02:15.724
How much for this stupid
star fish standee?
这个傻子多少钱
星鱼站着吗？

02:15.793 --> 02:16.862
- Hmm?
- 唔？

02:16.931 --> 02:19.344
Hmm.
[giggles]
唔。
[咯咯笑]

02:19.413 --> 02:21.517
20 bucks?
20块钱？

02:21.586 --> 02:24.482
- [grunts]
But it's damaged.
- [咕哝]
但它已损坏。

02:24.551 --> 02:26.068
- 10 bucks?
- 10 块钱？

02:26.137 --> 02:28.034
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

02:28.103 --> 02:29.620
- Sold!
- 卖！

02:30.724 --> 02:32.655
[munching, gulp]
[咀嚼，吞咽]

02:32.724 --> 02:34.137
- [belches]
- [打嗝]

02:34.206 --> 02:35.586
[crowd shouting]
[人群喊叫]

02:35.655 --> 02:37.344
- Hi--uh!
- 嗨——呃！

02:37.413 --> 02:38.241
[grunts]
[咕哝]

02:38.310 --> 02:39.862
- And here's our hero now
- 现在这是我们的英雄

02:39.931 --> 02:42.758
with the flag
he will plant on the surface.
与旗帜
他将在表面上种植。

02:42.827 --> 02:45.137
- Thank you! Thank you!
- 谢谢你！谢谢你！

02:45.206 --> 02:46.758
Thank you!
谢谢你！

02:46.827 --> 02:50.034
[drumroll]
[鼓声]

02:51.482 --> 02:53.586
[triumphant music]
[胜利的音乐]

02:53.655 --> 02:54.586
Ahh!
啊！

02:54.655 --> 02:55.482
Ooh.
哦。

02:55.551 --> 02:58.448
[crowd groans, murmurs]
[人群呻吟，低语]

02:58.517 --> 03:01.344
- Get your SpongeBob standees
right here.
- 获取你的海绵宝宝立像
就在这里。

03:01.413 --> 03:04.103
Buy one and take home
a loser.
买一个带回家
一个失败者。

03:04.172 --> 03:06.758
- I just don't understand it.
- 我只是不明白。

03:06.827 --> 03:08.413
Surface divers go down.
水面潜水员下潜。

03:08.482 --> 03:10.344
Why didn't I go up?
我怎么没上去？

03:10.413 --> 03:12.344
- Well, back in Texas,
Olympic divers
- 好吧，回到德克萨斯州，
奥运跳水运动员

03:12.413 --> 03:14.241
have gravity
to help them go down.
有重力
帮助他们下去。

03:14.310 --> 03:17.758
What you need
is anti-gravity to go up.
你需要什么
是反重力上去的。

03:18.862 --> 03:21.172
- Anti-gravity? Yes!
- 反重力？是的！

03:21.241 --> 03:22.793
Yah!
啊！

03:24.551 --> 03:25.482
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

03:25.551 --> 03:28.758
[triumphant music]
[胜利的音乐]

03:28.827 --> 03:33.000
- Hmph. Stupid messy moron
rubbernecking flounders
- 哼。愚蠢又凌乱的白痴
橡皮颈比目鱼

03:33.068 --> 03:34.137
and so on...
等等...

03:34.206 --> 03:36.793
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

03:36.862 --> 03:38.000
- [grumbling]
- [抱怨]

03:38.068 --> 03:40.275
- I'm doing it! I'm doing it!
- 我正在做！我正在做！

03:40.344 --> 03:43.448
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:43.517 --> 03:46.275
Ahh...
啊...

03:46.344 --> 03:52.758
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:52.827 --> 03:56.172
I'm the first
high-sea-diving sponge.
我是第一个
远海潜水海绵。

03:56.241 --> 03:57.620
[groans]
[呻吟]

03:57.689 --> 04:03.655
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:05.241 --> 04:06.965
Hey, what happened
to the surface?
嘿，发生了什么事
到表面？

04:07.034 --> 04:09.172
[ominous music]
[不祥的音乐]

04:09.241 --> 04:10.724
Hmm. Huh?
唔。啊？

04:10.793 --> 04:12.275
[grunts]
[咕哝]

04:12.344 --> 04:15.724
Aw, gee, and I was so close.
噢，天啊，我是如此接近。

04:16.758 --> 04:19.413
Hmm?
What is this place?
唔？
这是什么地方？

04:20.862 --> 04:22.172
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

04:22.241 --> 04:23.896
Oh!
哦！

04:23.965 --> 04:25.965
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

04:26.034 --> 04:31.896
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:31.965 --> 04:33.275
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

04:33.344 --> 04:36.275
[harp music]
[竖琴音乐]

04:36.344 --> 04:39.103
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:39.172 --> 04:41.379
[laughs]
[笑]

04:44.482 --> 04:47.379
This place is trash-tastic!
这个地方太垃圾了！

04:47.448 --> 04:50.862
[cries out]
[喊叫]

04:50.931 --> 04:52.000
Ow!
噢！

04:52.068 --> 04:53.482
Oh, hey now!
哦，嘿现在！

04:53.551 --> 04:55.413
Whoa-whoa-whoa-oh-oh!
哇-哇-哇-哦-哦！

04:59.206 --> 05:00.206
- What's that?
- 那是什么？

05:00.275 --> 05:02.344
[mysterious music]
[神秘的音乐]

05:02.413 --> 05:04.206
- I don't know.
- 我不知道。

05:04.275 --> 05:05.413
[twangy music]
[鼻音音乐]

05:05.482 --> 05:07.275
- Hmm. [grunts]
- 唔。 [咕哝]

05:07.344 --> 05:11.862
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:11.931 --> 05:15.068
- It's a gift!
- From the sky?
- 这是一份礼物！
- 从天上来的？

05:15.137 --> 05:17.000
- From Neptune!
- 来自海王星！

05:17.068 --> 05:18.172
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

05:18.241 --> 05:19.724
all: Yay!
全体：耶！

05:19.793 --> 05:21.620
Aww.
哇。

05:21.689 --> 05:23.310
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

05:23.379 --> 05:25.482
all: Thank you, Neptune!
全体：谢谢你，海王星！

05:25.551 --> 05:28.068
["Here Comes the Bride" tune]
【《新娘来了》曲子】

05:28.137 --> 05:29.482
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:29.551 --> 05:31.482
- I'm sorry, honey.
- 对不起，亲爱的。

05:31.551 --> 05:33.379
I couldn't afford
the whole house.
我买不起
整个房子。

05:33.448 --> 05:35.482
Just the door!
就在门口！

05:37.034 --> 05:38.655
[mysterious music]
[神秘的音乐]

05:38.724 --> 05:40.517
Whoa-ho-ho-ho!
Look at that!
哇-嗬-嗬-嗬！
看看那个！

05:40.586 --> 05:42.827
- Now there's room
for my mother!
- 现在有空间了
为了我的妈妈！

05:42.896 --> 05:43.827
- Whaa?
- 哇？

05:43.896 --> 05:45.965
- Ehh...
- 呃...

05:46.034 --> 05:48.620
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:48.689 --> 05:51.206
- Hmm? I thought
I saw something over--
- 唔？我以为
我看到了一些东西——

05:51.275 --> 05:53.310
Ow!
噢！

05:53.379 --> 05:54.862
- [raspy breathing]
- [粗重的呼吸]

05:54.931 --> 05:57.206
- Hello?
Who are you?
- 你好？
你是谁？

05:57.275 --> 06:00.034
- I'm King Neptune!
- 我是海王星国王！

06:00.103 --> 06:02.827
Feel my power!
感受我的力量！

06:04.965 --> 06:06.103
- Ow!
- 噢！

06:06.172 --> 06:09.482
Old Man Jenkins?
老詹金斯？

06:09.551 --> 06:12.724
- I'm not Old Man Jenkins
anymore!
- 我不是老詹金斯
不再了！

06:12.793 --> 06:16.379
I'm King Neptune!
Take that!
我是海王星国王！
拿那个！

06:16.448 --> 06:17.689
- [whimpers]
Huh?
- [呜咽]
啊？

06:17.758 --> 06:19.620
All right, I'll play along.
好吧，我也跟着玩。

06:19.689 --> 06:22.620
Hey, King Neptune!
I'm Poseidon!
嘿，海王星国王！
我是波塞冬！

06:22.689 --> 06:23.724
[laughs]
[笑]

06:26.068 --> 06:27.931
- Oh!
[grunts]
- 哦！
[咕哝]

06:28.000 --> 06:31.482
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

06:33.275 --> 06:36.000
[slide whistle]
[幻灯片哨子]

06:36.068 --> 06:37.827
[lively music]
[活泼的音乐]

06:37.896 --> 06:41.206
- Neptune is blessing us
with gifts and treasures!
- 海王星正在祝福我们
带着礼物和宝藏！

06:41.275 --> 06:42.275
[grunts]
[咕哝]

06:42.344 --> 06:43.931
Surf's up, dude!
冲浪了，伙计！

06:44.000 --> 06:45.758
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

06:45.827 --> 06:46.896
- Oh!
- 哦！

06:46.965 --> 06:49.793
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

06:49.862 --> 06:52.310
- Oh, yeah!
All right! Ho-ho!
- 哦，是的！
好的！嗬嗬！

06:52.379 --> 06:55.310
- You say your desire
into the balloon,
- 你说出你的愿望
进入气球，

06:55.379 --> 06:58.965
blow it up,
and send it to Neptune.
炸毁它，
并将其发送给海王星。

06:59.034 --> 07:01.827
A slice of pizza.
一片披萨。

07:01.896 --> 07:04.793
[gasps, exhales]
[喘气，呼气]

07:04.862 --> 07:07.862
- A never-ending roll
of toilet paper.
- 永无休止的滚动
卫生纸。

07:07.931 --> 07:09.931
[gasps, exhales]
[喘气，呼气]

07:10.000 --> 07:11.551
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:11.620 --> 07:13.931
- A million grandmas.
- 一百万祖母。

07:14.000 --> 07:16.137
[gasps, exhales]
[喘气，呼气]

07:16.206 --> 07:18.413
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:18.482 --> 07:21.689
[both grunting, groaning]
[两人都咕哝着，呻吟着]

07:24.413 --> 07:26.655
- You're not Poseidon.
- 你不是波塞冬。

07:26.724 --> 07:29.586
You're SpongeBob SquarePants.
你是海绵宝宝。

07:29.655 --> 07:31.896
- And you're
Old Man Jenkins!
- 而你是
老詹金斯！

07:31.965 --> 07:36.655
- I was Old Man Jenkins
till I came here.
- 我是老詹金斯
直到我来到这里。

07:36.724 --> 07:40.000
It was a year ago today...
一年前的今天了...

07:40.068 --> 07:41.517
[twinkling music]
[闪烁的音乐]

07:41.586 --> 07:46.655
all:
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪
全部：
♪ 祝你生日快乐 ♪

07:47.517 --> 07:49.862
- Oh, thank you, dea--
-哦，谢谢你，亲爱的--

07:49.931 --> 07:51.000
Hello?
你好？

07:51.068 --> 07:52.413
Some help, please?
请帮忙吗？

07:52.482 --> 07:53.517
[all grumbling]
[大家都在抱怨]

07:53.586 --> 07:54.620
- So now I gotta go back?
- 所以现在我得回去了？

07:54.689 --> 07:56.413
I came all the way over here.
我千里迢迢来到这里。

07:56.482 --> 07:58.137
- Hey--hey, come back.
- 嘿嘿，回来吧。

07:58.206 --> 07:59.482
Come back, now!
快回来吧！

08:00.517 --> 08:02.793
- Neptune,
I want a mustache.
- 海王星，
我想要胡子。

08:02.862 --> 08:05.482
- Neptune, I want a cool voice.
- 海王星，我想要一个很酷的声音。

08:05.551 --> 08:09.103
- Neptune, I want
another balloon.
- 海王星，我想要
另一个气球。

08:09.172 --> 08:10.689
Now!
现在！

08:10.758 --> 08:13.620
- My subjects!
I must get down to help them.
- 我的科目！
我必须下来帮助他们。

08:13.689 --> 08:15.448
- Well, we could build a ladder
out of this stuff
- 好吧，我们可以建一个梯子
从这个东西中

08:15.517 --> 08:18.551
and climb down--ooh,
uh, down?
然后爬下来——哦，
呃，下来？

08:18.620 --> 08:21.310
- What are you, senile?
- 你是什么，老人？

08:21.379 --> 08:23.448
- Uh-uh. I'm juvenile!
- 呃呃。我还未成年啊！

08:23.517 --> 08:25.172
[laughs]
[笑]

08:25.241 --> 08:26.448
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

08:26.517 --> 08:28.793
[squeaking]
[吱吱声]

08:31.827 --> 08:33.344
- Hey, what happened?
- What's going on here?
- 嘿，发生了什么事？
- 这是怎么回事？

08:33.413 --> 08:36.448
- Why isn't Neptune sending
more gifts down for us?
- 为什么海王星不发送
还有更多礼物给我们吗？

08:36.517 --> 08:38.448
- We must have upset him.
- 我们一定让他不高兴了。

08:38.517 --> 08:40.068
- You must have upset him!
- 你一定让他不高兴了！

08:40.137 --> 08:42.310
This is for you, Neptune.
这是给你的，海王星。

08:42.379 --> 08:44.413
Oohh--
- Wait! Look!
哦哦——
- 等等！看！

08:44.482 --> 08:45.655
[crowd gasps]
[人群喘息]

08:45.724 --> 08:47.241
[excited chatter]
[兴奋的喋喋不休]

08:47.310 --> 08:49.103
- Oh, it's the most amazing
thing I've ever seen.
- 哦，这是最神奇的
我见过的东西。

08:49.172 --> 08:50.482
- What is it?
- 这是什么？

08:50.551 --> 08:51.724
- What do you think it is?
- 你认为它是什么？

08:51.793 --> 08:53.793
- It's a ladder
from Neptune!
- 这是一个梯子
来自海王星！

08:53.862 --> 08:56.379
Let's climb up
and get more free stuff!
我们爬上去
并获得更多免费的东西！

08:56.448 --> 08:58.344
- Me first!
[grunts]
- 我先！
[咕哝]

08:58.413 --> 09:01.724
[laughing]
[笑]

09:01.793 --> 09:04.827
[crowd murmuring]
[人群窃窃私语]

09:04.896 --> 09:06.482
- [grunts]
Phew!
- [咕哝]
唷！

09:06.551 --> 09:09.689
It took every piece of
the island to make this ladder.
花费了每一块
制作这个梯子的岛。

09:09.758 --> 09:12.586
Ooh? Hey!
Look at that!
哦？嘿！
看看那个！

09:12.655 --> 09:15.965
[triumphant music]
[胜利的音乐]

09:16.034 --> 09:18.724
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:18.793 --> 09:21.068
I'm the first sponge
to ever do that!
我是第一块海绵
永远这样做！

09:21.137 --> 09:22.586
- Big whoop.
- 大呼喊。

09:22.655 --> 09:24.689
- Oh, yes!
It's the biggest whoop!
- 哦是的！
这是最大的欢呼！

09:24.758 --> 09:26.896
Let's go home!
我们回家吧！

09:28.413 --> 09:29.965
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

09:30.034 --> 09:31.241
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

09:31.310 --> 09:33.344
- Stop shaking the ladder!
- 别摇晃梯子了！

09:33.413 --> 09:34.620
- I'm not shaking it!
- 我不会摇晃它！

09:34.689 --> 09:37.103
[mischievous music]
[恶作剧的音乐]

09:37.172 --> 09:39.137
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:39.206 --> 09:42.482
- I think I see him!
It's Neptune!
- 我想我看到他了！
这是海王星！

09:42.551 --> 09:45.034
- Oh, Neptune! Neptune!
- Out of my way!
- 哦，海王星！海王星！
- 别挡我的路！

09:45.103 --> 09:49.068
[all chattering]
[大家都在喋喋不休]

09:49.137 --> 09:50.931
- Wait a minute.
- 等一下。

09:51.000 --> 09:52.344
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

09:52.413 --> 09:53.758
- It's Old Man Jenkins!
- 这是老詹金斯！

09:53.827 --> 09:55.896
- Old Man Jenkins
is Neptune?
——老詹金斯
是海王星吗？

09:55.965 --> 09:58.517
- All hail
Old Man Jenkins!
- 万岁
老詹金斯！

09:58.586 --> 10:00.793
- Get off my trash,
you idiots!
- 从我的垃圾堆里滚出来，
你们这些白痴！

10:00.862 --> 10:04.482
- Praise Neptune!
We're all idiots for you!
- 赞美海王星！
在你眼里我们都是白痴！

10:04.551 --> 10:06.448
all:
We're all idiots!
全部：
我们都是白痴！

10:06.517 --> 10:08.206
We're all idiots!
我们都是白痴！

10:08.275 --> 10:09.310
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

10:09.379 --> 10:12.551
Ooh-whaa!
噢-哇！

10:12.620 --> 10:14.965
- Hey, it's SpongeBob!
- 嘿，这是海绵宝宝！

10:15.034 --> 10:18.965
- Everybody climb back down.
There's nothing up there!
- 大家都爬下来。
上面什么也没有！

10:19.034 --> 10:20.103
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

10:20.172 --> 10:22.000
I dove up and found
Old Man Jenkins
我潜入水中并发现
老詹金斯

10:22.068 --> 10:23.862
living among
all these objects.
生活在
所有这些物体。

10:23.931 --> 10:26.896
- Then it was you that you sent
these treasures down!
- 那么是你送来的
这些宝物落下！

10:26.965 --> 10:30.379
- Hooray for SpongeBob!
He's our hero!
- 海绵宝宝万岁！
他是我们的英雄！

10:30.448 --> 10:34.310
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

10:34.379 --> 10:35.862
- No! Ahh!
- 不！啊！

10:35.931 --> 10:37.413
Ohh--ow!
噢——噢！

10:37.482 --> 10:40.655
Yahhh!
啊啊！

10:43.206 --> 10:45.689
[sad music]
[悲伤的音乐]

10:45.758 --> 10:48.689
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:48.758 --> 10:51.724
- I'm King Neptune!
- 我是海王星国王！

10:51.793 --> 10:54.551
King of the seven seas,
七大洋之王，

10:54.620 --> 10:57.965
the lakes, rivers, puddles...
湖泊、河流、水坑……

10:58.034 --> 10:59.103
[spits]
[吐口水]

10:59.172 --> 11:00.241
[ding]
[叮]

11:00.310 --> 11:01.827
And spit too.
还吐口水。

11:01.896 --> 11:04.068
I'm the king of spit!
我是口水王！

11:04.137 --> 11:06.655
- So you're
the king of spit?
- 所以你是
吐口水之王？

11:06.724 --> 11:08.103
[thunder booms]
[雷霆轰鸣]

11:08.172 --> 11:09.379
- Uh-oh.
- 呃哦。

11:09.448 --> 11:11.482
[seahorse neighs]
[海马嘶鸣]

11:11.551 --> 11:14.068
- "Uh-oh" is right.
- “呃哦”是对的。

11:14.137 --> 11:16.586
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

11:16.655 --> 11:18.413
- [shouts]
- [喊叫]

11:18.482 --> 11:20.275
[zapping]
[电击]

11:20.344 --> 11:21.586
[sizzling]
[嘶嘶声]

11:21.655 --> 11:23.551
- I smell like toast.
- 我闻起来像吐司。

11:23.620 --> 11:25.379
Am I breakfast?
我是早餐吗？

11:25.448 --> 11:27.206
[munching]
[咀嚼]

11:27.275 --> 11:29.103
Needs jelly.
需要果冻。

11:29.172 --> 11:30.517
[lively music]
[活泼的音乐]

11:30.586 --> 11:31.931
- Hmm?
- 唔？

11:32.000 --> 11:32.862
[grunts]
[咕哝]

11:32.931 --> 11:34.517
Ooh, well, look at that.
哦，好吧，看看那个。

11:34.586 --> 11:38.310
Someone threw away a perfectly
good SpongeBob standee.
有人完美地扔掉了
海绵宝宝的好站姿。

11:38.379 --> 11:40.482
[laughs]
[笑]

11:40.551 --> 11:41.551
Yagh!
呀！

11:41.620 --> 11:43.448
Oof! Ugh.
钱币！啊。

11:43.517 --> 11:46.758
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:46.827 --> 11:49.034
- They called me a hero.
- 他们称我为英雄。

11:51.862 --> 11:54.793
[jazzy music]
[爵士乐]

11:54.862 --> 12:01.103
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:03.034 --> 12:04.241
- Ooh--[gasps]
- 哦--[喘气]

12:04.310 --> 12:05.965
Ooh--[gasps]
Yeah!
哦——[喘气]
是啊！

12:06.034 --> 12:08.655
Don't you just love
cleaning day?
你不就是爱吗
清洁日？

12:08.724 --> 12:10.896
- We're so lucky.
- 我们真幸运。

12:10.965 --> 12:12.413
- Aww.
- 哇。

12:12.482 --> 12:15.413
Mr. Krabs's first dollar.
蟹老板的第一块钱。

12:15.482 --> 12:17.206
[squeaking]
[吱吱声]

12:17.275 --> 12:19.620
Whaa?
哇？

12:19.689 --> 12:22.551
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:22.620 --> 12:23.758
Huh?
啊？

12:23.827 --> 12:29.172
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:29.241 --> 12:31.206
- Don't forget to clean
the safe, boys.
- 别忘了清洁
保险箱，孩子们。

12:31.275 --> 12:34.586
And keep your eyes on the
Krabby Patty Secret Formula!
并密切关注
蟹黄饼秘密配方！

12:34.655 --> 12:36.068
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:36.137 --> 12:37.965
-Hey, we need
the combination!
-嘿，我们需要
组合！

12:38.034 --> 12:39.241
- I got it covered.
- 我把它盖住了。

12:40.793 --> 12:41.758
[snaps]
[快照]

12:41.827 --> 12:42.758
- Nyah!
- 呀！

12:42.827 --> 12:44.758
- [hums]
Doink!
- [哼哼]
多因克！

12:44.827 --> 12:47.379
[chuckling]
[轻笑]

12:47.448 --> 12:49.241
Mm. Mm-hmm.
毫米。嗯嗯。

12:50.517 --> 12:51.689
Voilà.
瞧。

12:51.758 --> 12:53.551
- Ahh--ooh!
- 啊——哦！

12:53.620 --> 12:56.172
- See? This is fun!
- 看？这很有趣！

12:57.620 --> 12:59.379
- [evil laughter]
- [邪恶的笑声]

12:59.448 --> 13:03.344
Krabs will never
see me coming!
螃蟹永远不会
看到我来了！

13:03.413 --> 13:05.724
Presso-inviso!
Presso-inviso！
Presso-inviso！
Presso-inviso！

13:05.793 --> 13:08.724
[mysterious music]
[神秘的音乐]

13:08.793 --> 13:11.689
[humming]
Ahh!
[嗡嗡声]
啊！

13:11.758 --> 13:13.379
Can't see my own feet.
看不到自己的脚。

13:13.448 --> 13:14.793
- Mm-hmm.
- 嗯嗯。

13:14.862 --> 13:18.758
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

13:18.827 --> 13:22.482
Don't you go anywhere
while I clean your homey-womey.
你别去任何地方
当我清理你的家的时候。

13:25.758 --> 13:26.862
- Out of sight...
- 看不见...

13:26.931 --> 13:28.068
- [evil laugh]
- [邪恶的笑声]

13:28.137 --> 13:29.517
- Out of my mind.
=> - 从我的脑海中消失。

13:29.586 --> 13:31.379
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

13:31.448 --> 13:33.655
Hey, watch it!
嘿，注意看！

13:33.724 --> 13:35.620
[blubbers]
Hommina-wah?
[哭声]
霍米纳哇？

13:35.689 --> 13:37.103
The Secret Formula!
秘密配方！

13:37.172 --> 13:39.689
Must be one of Krabs's tricks!
这肯定是蟹蟹的诡计之一！

13:39.758 --> 13:41.206
[grunts]
[咕哝]

13:41.275 --> 13:42.344
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

13:42.413 --> 13:44.793
He'll pop out any second now.
他现在随时都会跳出来。

13:44.862 --> 13:47.310
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

13:47.379 --> 13:48.689
Well?
出色地？

13:48.758 --> 13:51.000
[crickets chirping]
[蟋蟀鸣叫]

13:51.068 --> 13:52.310
Nothing. All right.
没有什么。好的。

13:52.379 --> 13:54.413
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

13:54.482 --> 13:56.206
I really did it!
我真的做到了！

13:56.275 --> 13:59.413
Hey, Karen, guess what!
嘿，凯伦，你猜怎么着！

13:59.482 --> 14:02.862
I finally got the Krabby Patty
Secret Formula.
我终于吃到蟹黄饼了
秘密配方。

14:02.931 --> 14:04.965
How you like me now?
你现在怎么样？

14:05.034 --> 14:06.862
[electronic warbling]
[电子颤音]

14:06.931 --> 14:08.620
- It's genuine.
- 这是正品。

14:08.689 --> 14:12.344
Come here, you big hunk
of aquatic organism!
过来，你这个大块头
水生生物！

14:12.413 --> 14:13.965
Ooh, I knew you could do it!
哦，我知道你能做到！

14:14.034 --> 14:15.241
[smooching]
[接吻]

14:15.310 --> 14:17.724
Just don't blow it this time.
只是这次别吹了。

14:19.206 --> 14:22.517
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

14:22.586 --> 14:23.931
Oh! Oh! Ahh!
哦！哦！啊！

14:24.000 --> 14:25.448
Hey, Squidward,
嘿，章鱼哥，

14:25.517 --> 14:28.655
have you seen the Krabby Patty
Secret Formula?
你见过蟹黄饼吗
秘密配方？

14:28.724 --> 14:30.172
Ohh!
哦！

14:30.241 --> 14:33.344
I put it right here in this
circular file cabinet.
我把它放在这里
圆形文件柜。

14:33.413 --> 14:36.068
- That's a trash can,
you nitwit!
- 那是一个垃圾桶，
你这个白痴！

14:36.137 --> 14:37.068
The formula!
公式！

14:37.137 --> 14:38.413
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

14:38.482 --> 14:40.827
- Face it, SpongeBob!
The formula...
- 面对现实吧，海绵宝宝！
公式...

14:40.896 --> 14:42.965
- Don't say it!
- Is gone.
- 别说！
- 走了。

14:43.034 --> 14:46.000
- Oh. I asked you
not to say it.
- 哦。我问你
不说了。

14:46.068 --> 14:51.000
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

14:51.068 --> 14:53.000
Why would you even do that?
你为什么要这么做？

14:53.068 --> 14:55.137
- Come on.
- 快点。

14:56.413 --> 14:59.517
Now let's see if the security
cameras picked anything up.
现在让我们看看安全性是否
摄像机拍到了任何东西。

14:59.586 --> 15:00.724
[whirs, clicks]
[呼呼声，咔哒声]

15:00.793 --> 15:02.517
Hmm.
- [gasps]
唔。
- [喘气]

15:02.586 --> 15:03.931
- Hi!
- 你好！

15:04.000 --> 15:06.517
I'd like to order--hmm--
我想订购--嗯--

15:06.586 --> 15:08.862
half a Krabby Patty, please!
请吃半个蟹黄饼！

15:08.931 --> 15:11.758
Oh, thank you.
[laughs]
哦，谢谢。
[笑]

15:11.827 --> 15:13.758
[munching]
[咀嚼]

15:13.827 --> 15:15.620
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

15:15.689 --> 15:19.034
- [munching]
- [咀嚼]

15:20.000 --> 15:21.965
[both exclaim, groan]
[两人惊呼，呻吟]

15:22.034 --> 15:23.241
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

15:23.310 --> 15:25.000
- Ah! It's alive!
- 啊！它还活着！

15:25.068 --> 15:27.034
- Hold on.
- 坚持，稍等。

15:28.965 --> 15:31.379
Plankton?
- Ahh!
浮游生物？
- 啊！

15:31.448 --> 15:33.586
[gasping]
What are we gonna do?
[喘气]
我们要做什么？

15:33.655 --> 15:36.689
- [gasping]
- [喘气]

15:38.275 --> 15:39.793
Okay. All right.
好的。好的。

15:39.862 --> 15:42.758
We'll just pretend everything's
normal until closing time.
我们就假装一切如常
正常直到关门时间。

15:42.827 --> 15:45.344
Then we'll steal the formula
back from Plankton!
然后我们就窃取公式
从浮游生物回来了！

15:45.413 --> 15:46.517
Yeah.
是的。

15:47.551 --> 15:50.000
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

15:50.068 --> 15:54.000
Come on! Open up!
快点！打开！

15:54.068 --> 15:55.275
[grunts]
[咕哝]

15:55.344 --> 15:57.758
[chomps]
Ahh!
[咀嚼]
啊！

15:57.827 --> 16:00.827
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

16:00.896 --> 16:03.517
Open Sesame.
芝麻开门。

16:03.586 --> 16:10.344
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

16:10.413 --> 16:13.586
It's no use, Karen.
It won't budge.
这是没有用的，凯伦。
它不会让步。

16:13.655 --> 16:16.689
- Of course not, Einstein,
it has a time lock.
- 当然不是，爱因斯坦，
它有一个时间锁。

16:16.758 --> 16:19.517
It won't open until
tomorrow morning.
直到
明天早上。

16:19.586 --> 16:22.551
- Well, I've waited this long.
- 嗯，我等了这么久了。

16:22.620 --> 16:24.000
What's a few more
还有几个啥

16:24.068 --> 16:30.241
excruciatingly long hours?
工作时间长得令人难以忍受？

16:31.344 --> 16:32.620
- Night, Mr. Krabs.
- 晚安，蟹老板。

16:32.689 --> 16:33.827
Sleep tight.
睡个好觉。

16:33.896 --> 16:36.413
- Don't let the
bed urchins bite.
- 不要让
床上的海胆会咬人。

16:36.482 --> 16:37.862
- Eh, sure.
- 呃，当然。

16:37.931 --> 16:40.793
You, too, you two.
你们也一样，你们两个。

16:40.862 --> 16:42.068
[engine whirring]
[引擎的呼呼声]

16:42.137 --> 16:44.103
[both laughing nervously]
[两人紧张地笑]

16:44.172 --> 16:46.758
- Okay, let's go get
that formula.
- 好吧，我们去吧
那个公式。

16:46.827 --> 16:51.620
- Ooh, we are gonna
pull a Plankton on Plankton!
- 哦，我们要去
把浮游生物拉到浮游生物上！

16:51.689 --> 16:53.103
[laughs]
[笑]

16:53.896 --> 16:56.448
[sneaky music]
[偷偷摸摸的音乐]

16:56.517 --> 16:58.241
[cat yowls]
- Nyah! Whaa?
[猫叫声]
- 呀！哇？

16:58.310 --> 16:59.793
- Sorry. [laughs]
- 对不起。 [笑]

16:59.862 --> 17:01.034
Stepped on my tail.
踩到了我的尾巴。

17:01.103 --> 17:02.344
- What are you wearing?
- 你将如何穿着？

17:02.413 --> 17:03.931
- I'm a cat burglar!
- 我是一只猫贼！

17:04.000 --> 17:06.241
[purring]
[咕噜声]

17:06.310 --> 17:08.206
Okay, I'll change.
好吧，我会改变的。

17:08.275 --> 17:10.241
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

17:10.310 --> 17:12.482
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

17:12.551 --> 17:14.620
- Hang on.
Ooh.
- 不挂断。
哦。

17:14.689 --> 17:18.103
- And just how am I
supposed to get in?
- 我怎么样
应该进去吗？

17:18.172 --> 17:19.551
Ooh!
哦！

17:21.034 --> 17:22.275
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

17:22.344 --> 17:29.551
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

17:31.965 --> 17:34.793
[spooky music]
[诡异的音乐]

17:34.862 --> 17:36.137
- Ahh!
- 啊！

17:36.206 --> 17:39.310
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

17:39.379 --> 17:41.689
- Yeah, yeah,
now eat her brain!
- 是啊，是啊，
现在吃掉她的大脑！

17:41.758 --> 17:44.137
[sighs]
I love a good romance.
[叹气]
我喜欢美好的浪漫。

17:44.206 --> 17:47.379
[yawns, grunts]
[打哈欠，咕哝]

17:47.448 --> 17:54.551
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

17:54.620 --> 17:57.655
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

18:00.758 --> 18:03.241
[gargling]
[漱口]

18:03.310 --> 18:10.517
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

18:11.896 --> 18:13.310
[both yelp]
[两人都尖叫]

18:13.379 --> 18:15.655
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

18:15.724 --> 18:17.000
both: Phew.
两人：唷。

18:17.068 --> 18:18.103
[ding]
[叮]

18:18.172 --> 18:19.758
- Goodnight, honey.
- 晚安，亲爱的。

18:19.827 --> 18:20.758
[smooches]
[亲吻]

18:20.827 --> 18:24.586
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

18:28.827 --> 18:31.758
[sneaky music]
[偷偷摸摸的音乐]

18:31.827 --> 18:33.172
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

18:33.241 --> 18:34.482
- What are you doing?
- 你在干什么？

18:34.551 --> 18:36.344
- Making sure he's asleep.
- 确保他睡着了。

18:36.413 --> 18:39.620
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

18:43.793 --> 18:45.068
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

18:45.137 --> 18:49.793
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

18:49.862 --> 18:50.793
[growling]
[咆哮]

18:50.862 --> 18:52.724
- Yeesh!
[gulps]
- 是啊！
[吞咽]

18:53.724 --> 18:55.137
Squidward!
章鱼哥！

18:55.206 --> 18:58.758
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

19:00.655 --> 19:03.275
Aww, it's Plankton's
little pet, Spot.
哇，这是浮游生物的
小宠物，斑点。

19:03.344 --> 19:04.448
He wants to play!
他想玩！

19:04.517 --> 19:07.172
- Will you get him off of me?
- 你能让他离开我吗？

19:07.241 --> 19:09.965
- Hmm. Ahh!
- 唔。啊！

19:11.517 --> 19:13.413
[whistles]
Get the stick, boy!
[口哨声]
拿起棍子，孩子！

19:13.482 --> 19:15.206
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

19:15.275 --> 19:16.758
[barking]
[叫声]

19:16.827 --> 19:18.551
- Fetch!
- 拿来！

19:20.793 --> 19:21.931
- Look out!
- 小心！

19:23.517 --> 19:27.379
- Diodes...zebras...
- 二极管...斑马...

19:27.448 --> 19:29.931
Make a new batch of chum...
[snores]
做一批新的密友...
[打鼾]

19:30.000 --> 19:32.275
- It's okay.
She's in sleep mode.
- 没关系。
她正处于睡眠模式。

19:32.344 --> 19:36.034
- Oh, dear,
the chum is escaping.
- 哦，亲爱的，
密友正在逃跑。

19:36.103 --> 19:37.310
[both exclaim]
[两人惊呼]

19:43.000 --> 19:44.931
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

19:52.068 --> 19:55.000
[sneaky music]
[偷偷摸摸的音乐]

19:55.068 --> 20:00.000
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

20:00.068 --> 20:01.344
- This must be it.
- 一定是这个。

20:01.413 --> 20:04.034
[alarm blares]
[警报声]

20:04.103 --> 20:06.862
- Remain still for retina scan.
- 保持静止进行视网膜扫描。

20:06.931 --> 20:09.827
- Now what'll we do?
- Good thing I brought this!
- 现在我们该怎么办？
- 还好我带了这个！

20:09.896 --> 20:11.896
They really captured the cute
little dimple on his chin.
他们真的捕捉到了可爱
下巴上有一个小酒窝。

20:11.965 --> 20:14.275
- Looks like they captured
the rest of him too!
- 看起来他们捕获了
他的其余部分也是如此！

20:14.344 --> 20:19.965
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

20:20.034 --> 20:21.206
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

20:21.275 --> 20:22.275
- Oh!
- 哦！

20:22.344 --> 20:23.379
- I'll take it from here.
- 我会从这里拿走它。

20:23.448 --> 20:24.793
- I'm fine.
- 我很好。

20:24.862 --> 20:26.586
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

20:29.689 --> 20:31.689
You go first this time.
这次你先走。

20:31.758 --> 20:33.000
- Hmm-mmph.
- 嗯嗯。

20:37.103 --> 20:38.413
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

20:38.482 --> 20:41.034
- You okay?
- No!
- 你还好吗？
- 不！

20:41.103 --> 20:42.241
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

20:42.310 --> 20:44.862
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

20:44.931 --> 20:46.827
Ow.
噢。

20:46.896 --> 20:49.517
- I'm standing still!
I'm not even doing anything!
- 我站着不动！
我什至什么也没做！

20:54.275 --> 20:55.413
[foghorn blows]
[雾号吹响]

20:55.482 --> 20:57.379
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

20:57.448 --> 21:00.517
- Heh...sorry.
- 呃...抱歉。

21:00.586 --> 21:04.275
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

21:04.344 --> 21:06.586
Ahh.
啊。

21:07.862 --> 21:09.448
I can't believe
that actually worked!
我不敢相信
这确实有效！

21:09.517 --> 21:12.689
[alarm blaring]
[警报声]

21:16.482 --> 21:19.689
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

21:21.586 --> 21:24.103
[both groaning]
[两人都呻吟]

21:24.172 --> 21:26.068
[cheery music]
[欢快的音乐]

21:26.137 --> 21:27.758
- Good morning, Krusty crew!
- 早上好，Krusty 船员！

21:27.827 --> 21:30.965
Ready to cook up a
new batch of Krabby Patties?
准备煮一个
新一批蟹黄饼？

21:31.034 --> 21:32.586
Er...
呃……

21:32.655 --> 21:35.586
Why are you two
smoldering?
为什么你们两个
闷烧？

21:35.655 --> 21:37.586
- We're sorry, Mr. Krabs!
- 很抱歉，蟹老板！

21:37.655 --> 21:38.896
- No, he's delirious!
- 不，他神志不清！

21:38.965 --> 21:40.482
He doesn't know
what he's saying.
他不知道
他在说什么。

21:40.551 --> 21:42.689
- No! Mr. Krabs
deserves the truth.
- 不！蟹老板先生
值得真相。

21:42.758 --> 21:45.068
We accidentally threw away
the Krabby Patty Formula
我们不小心扔掉了
蟹黄饼配方

21:45.137 --> 21:46.517
and Plankton found it!
浮游生物发现了它！

21:46.586 --> 21:50.827
We tried to steal it back,
but we failed!
我们试图把它偷回来
但我们失败了！

21:50.896 --> 21:54.034
- You did what?
- 你做了什么？

21:54.103 --> 21:56.793
Plankton stole me formula?
浮游生物偷了我的配方奶粉？

21:56.862 --> 21:58.379
- That's what he said.
Yeah.
- 他就是这么说的。
是的。

21:58.448 --> 22:01.586
- Then I'll just
have to steal it back.
- 那我就
必须把它偷回来。

22:01.655 --> 22:03.379
[relaxing music]
[轻松的音乐]

22:03.448 --> 22:05.068
Hmm. Uh-huh.
唔。嗯嗯。

22:05.137 --> 22:06.827
[grunts]
Oh.
[咕哝]
哦。

22:06.896 --> 22:09.275
[smooches]
Don't worry.
[亲吻]
别担心。

22:09.344 --> 22:11.068
Papa's here.
爸爸来了。

22:13.103 --> 22:14.275
[rooster crow]
[公鸡打鸣]

22:14.344 --> 22:15.965
- Oh, yeah!
- 哦，是的！

22:16.034 --> 22:17.137
Who's the man?
那个男人是谁？

22:17.206 --> 22:18.931
You are!
你是！

22:19.000 --> 22:20.551
Eh, man.
呃，伙计。

22:21.344 --> 22:23.103
- [barking]
- [吠叫]

22:23.172 --> 22:26.965
- No, no, no!
- 不，不，不！

22:27.034 --> 22:28.655
Krabs!
螃蟹们！

22:30.172 --> 22:32.137
- [sighs] I'm sure glad
the formula is back
- [叹气]我很高兴
公式又回来了

22:32.206 --> 22:34.206
in the safe where it belongs,
Mr. Krabs.
在它所属的保险箱里，
蟹老板。

22:34.275 --> 22:36.620
- [laughs]
Me, too, boyo.
- [笑]
我也是，小伙子。

22:36.689 --> 22:38.379
And to make sure
you two don't ever
并确保
你们两个从来没有

22:38.448 --> 22:42.896
take your eyes off it again,
I have a surprise for you.
再次把目光从它身上移开
我有一个惊喜给你。

22:42.965 --> 22:46.068
You're me new security system.
你是我的新安全系统。

22:46.137 --> 22:47.310
[laughs]
[笑]

22:47.379 --> 22:49.172
- Yay!
- Wait!
- 耶！
- 等待！

22:49.241 --> 22:50.551
I'm claustrophobic!
我有幽闭恐惧症！

22:53.172 --> 22:56.103
[relaxed music]
[轻松的音乐]

22:56.172 --> 23:02.896
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

♪ ♪